{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1QZW5ndWluLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"The Penguin","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vOWcqC4oDQws1doDWLO7d3dh5qc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4TdmuuwiIiKw3JOjIuhdgYxRXnN.jpg","description":"With the city in peril following the seawall's collapse, Oswald \"Oz\" Cobb seeks to fill the power vacuum left by the death of Carmine Falcone and finally give his mother Francis the life he's always promised. But first, Oz must confront his enemies and his own demoralizing reputation as \"the Penguin.\"\n\nRated TV-MA · Ended · First aired 19 Sept 2024 · United States of America, Ireland · Language: English\nStudio: 6th & Idaho Motion Picture Company, Dylan Clark Productions, Warner Bros. Television · Network: HBO\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi, English (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Crime","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1QZW5ndWluLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"After Hours","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In the wake of Carmine Falcone's death, Oz attempts to legitimize himself among Gotham's criminal underworld.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ecX4IMGRlKwyq5eZd5sjPxtUTaT.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1QZW5ndWluLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Inside Man","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sofia works to secure her family's strength, while Oz attempts to play both the Falcone and Maroni families to his advantage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t7rC5DPfhcwowVJpz3vWtjqcTn8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1QZW5ndWluLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Bliss","season":1,"episode":3,